body:
@tonihei we re-initialize the player when we get `BehindLiveWindowException`, `player?.prepare()` and `player?.setMediaSource` gets called in this process, it is working properly on <2.13.0.

**Code**

```
if (isBehindLiveWindow(error)) {
    try {
        reInitPlayer()
    } catch (e : Exception) {
        e.printStackTrace()
    }
}

fun reInitPlayer() {
    initPlayer()
    setMediaSource(url)
}
```


To reproduce the issue easily, change the minBuffer and maxBuffer to 5000, pause the video for long time and resume the video.
